# About Our Cleaning Service

Source: [About Our Cleaning Service](https://beachlinecleaners.com/about/)

Beachline Cleaners is owner-operated and based in Brevard County, serving homes, vacation rentals, move-in/move-out properties, and workspaces across the Space Coast.

## Simple communication, start to finish.

Beachline Cleaners is independently owned and operated in Brevard County. When you call or text, you’re talking directly with the person running the business about the property, what needs cleaning, and the schedule.

Tell us what needs attention and any extras you want included. We’ll agree on the checklist, price, access, and timing before the visit, so you know exactly what was booked.

Have pets, delicate surfaces, or a product preference? Tell us when we set up the clean. If you’ll be out, we’ll work out secure access ahead of time.

- Cleaning checklist agreed before the visit
- Appliance interiors and other extras quoted separately
- Standard cleaning supplies and equipment provided

